    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"rest\"... that's exactly it. everything is just so loud and exhausting because i'm trying to maintain a shadow of something that isn't real anymore. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to finally end so i don't have to pretend anymore. do you think it's wrong to want to just... stop? to just let the shadow catch up to the person?",
